  <itemBody><p>A reading item asks the student to select the author's claim inside a short paragraph.</p><extendedTextInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE"><prompt>Read the paragraph and select the phrase that best states the author's claim.<div><p>Source options:</p><ul><li>A small green space would give nearby residents a shaded place to gather</li><li>The lot is 0.4 acres</li><li>The planning department posted the proposal last Tuesday</li><li>Two benches are stored in a public works warehouse</li></ul></div><p>The city should convert the vacant lot on Pine Street into a pocket park.  A small green space would give nearby residents a shaded place to gather , and volunteers have already offered to maintain native plants.  The lot is 0.4 acres  and sits next to a bus stop.  The planning department posted the proposal last Tuesday .  Two benches are stored in a public works warehouse .</p></prompt></extendedTextInteraction></itemBody>

